    "description": "Welcome to 2419-2421 16th Avenue, an exceptional opportunity in the heart of San Francisco's desirable Sunset neighborhood. This property features two vacant 1-bedroom units, offering immediate potential for homeowners, investors, or developers alike. Whether you envision rental income, multi-generational living, or future expansion, the possibilities are abundant.  The property also boasts a 2-car garage, with valuable development potential behind itperfect for adding living space or creating an outdoor oasis. Ideally located just moments from the vibrant Taraval Street corridor, you'll enjoy easy access to local restaurants, cafes, Safeway, and the L Taraval Muni line for effortless commuting.  A short distance from charming West Portal, this location offers a wonderful blend of neighborhood charm and city convenience. With shops, parks, schools, and public transit nearby, 2419-2421 16th Avenue presents a rare chance to create something truly special in one of San Francisco's most sought-after communities.  Don't miss this remarkable opportunity to unlock the full potential of this Sunset gem!"
